OL,3,AAsia markets jump as Nvidia boss Jensen
OL,4,AHuang reinstated after spy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FMajor stock markets in Asia have jumped
OL,7,Fafter Nvidia's reinstatement of Jensen
OL,8,FHuang
OL,10,FHis return is seen as welcome news for
OL,11,Fmuch of the technology industry, and
OL,12,Farguably several economies in this
OL,13,Fregion
OL,15,FUS President Donald Trump says he "made
OL,16,Fthe deal", adding he had spoken to
OL,17,FNvidia's board both "directly and
OL,18,Findirectly" about Huang
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/3
