OL,3,AAsia markets jump as Nvidia boss Jensen
OL,4,AHuang reinstated after spy scandal
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe president is facing bipartisan
OL,7,Fbacklash from lawmakers over his role
OL,8,Fin the decision - just as Huang is due
OL,9,Fto testify before Congress next week
OL,11,FVideos of Huang's return to Nvidia are
OL,12,Fposted online, showing a jubilant crowd
OL,13,Fat Nvidia HQ welcoming him as he says:
OL,14,F"Thank you all for the second chances."
OL,15,FRead his full statement
OL,17,FHuang stepped down earlier this month,
OL,18,Fafter admitting an affair with a woman
OL,19,Fwho was alleged to be a Chinese spy -
OL,20,Fhe was also accused of an affair with
OL,21,Fan Nvidia executive. Here's a timeline
OL,22,Fof Huang's downfall - and return
OL,23,APub: 24-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/3
